#20703
A Moss-Covered Stairwell~
  The entire stairwell appears to have been carved out of the earth, which
is damp and clay-like.  Thick green moss grows on almost every surface, making
for slippery walking and musty air.  The stairwell opens up into two rooms,
one above and one to the south.
~
