#20705
A Ruined Crypt~
  Refuse from whoever robbed this tomb has been unceremoniously piled in
the corner here.  Bits of broken bone jut out at odd angles from the rubble
of smashed vault lids and funeral pottery.  There were several burial
niches in the wall here, all have been cleaned out entirely leaving only
empty sockets.
~
