#20706
A Ruined Crypt~
  This is the beginning of an expansive burial chamber that extends to the
south.  The dead seem to have been buried in shallow pits in the floor and
niches in the walls. The crypt has been obviously desecrated by someone or
something, however.  Loose bones and funeral trapings have been ripped from
the walls and floor and strewn about the chamber, forming small piles of
refuse. The chamber extends to the south, where you can see alcoves in the
far walls.
~
