#20707
A Ruined Crypt~
  The walls and floor here are a honeycomb of empty burial niches.  At one
time hundreds of bodies must have been buried in this chamber.  Now all that
remains are the empty sockets where bodies once lay and the refuse left
behind by the looters.  The crypt extends to the south and west.
~
