#20708
A Ruined Crypt~
  The stench of decay is heavy in the air as you make your way about this
tomb.  The niches in this section of the chamber seem to be clogged with
unidentifiable refuse.  Upon further inspection of one of the floor vaults
you realize that it is in fact a refuse-clogged stairway that leads down
into darkness. The centre of the crypt is just to your east.
~
