#20709
Centre of the Crypt~
  The floor vault here is the largest in the entire crypt - obviously
designated for someone of importance.  Now, however, it is nothing more
than a shallow pit filled with pieces of smashed pottery and other funeral
trapings.  The crypt extends in all directions.
~
