A Ruined Crypt~
  The burial niches on this wall have been crudely cut from the surrounding
earth and are haphazardly spaced, suggesting that these were some of the
first niches used in this crypt.  A steep, pit-like tunnel extends down
into darkness here.  The bulk of the tomb is to your north.
